nt |\n| CUST-031 | status-page | v5 | 96.2 | percent-delivered | current |\n| CUST-032 | consumer | v5 | 94.4 | percent-delivered | current |\n| CUST-033 | merchant | v5 | 95.5 | percent-delivered | current |\n| CUST-034 | support | v5 | 96.6 | percent-delivered | superseded |\n| CUST-035 | status-page | v5 | 94.8 | percent-delivered | current |\n| CUST-036 | consumer | v5 | 95.9 | percent-delivered | current |\n| CUST-037 | merchant | v5 | 94.1 | percent-delivered | current |\n| CUST-038 | support | v5 | 95.2 | percent-delivered | current |\n| CUST-039 | status-page | v5 | 96.3 | percent-delivered | current |\n| CUST-040 | consumer | v5 | 94.5 | percent-delivered | current |\n| CUST-041 | merchant | v5 | 95.6 | percent-delivered | current |\n\n## Decision constraints\n\nPreserve delivery coverage, state vocabulary, contact capacity, forecast, privacy, and escalation.\nState owners, channels, timing, acknowledgment, alternate routes, and retirement evidence.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
